<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telecom Argentina.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telecom Argentina.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Telecom Argentina to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Friday at 39-3/8 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
